,"follow_social_url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC1jkymSVpw6m2lX_JMbaA_A"},{"follow_social_icon":{"img_full":"https://res.cloudinary.com/de1ep59a0/images/v1733836723/social-icon-fb-neutral-1/social-icon-fb-neutral-1.svg?_i=AA","img_alt":"Facebook"},"follow_social_url":"https://www.facebook.com/AgoraRE/"},{"follow_social_icon":{"img_full":"https://res.cloudinary.com/de1ep59a0/images/v1733836600/social-icon-spotify-neutral-1/social-icon-spotify-neutral-1.svg?_i=AA","img_alt":"Spotify"},"follow_social_url":"https://open.spotify.com/show/1i2O2zXFp6EZuUGtM4BHw5?si=4ff5e3fce8ac4959&nd=1"}],"partnership_content":"Agora is an investment management software company and is not an FDIC-insured bank. Banking services are provided by Thread Bank, Member FDIC. FDIC insurance is available for funds on deposit through Thread Bank, Member FDIC. FDIC deposit insurance covers the failure of an insured bank. Certain conditions must be satisfied for pass-through deposit insurance coverage to apply. \\r\\n</br></br>\\r\\nYour deposits qualify for up to $3,000,000 in FDIC insurance coverage when Thread Bank places them at program banks in its deposit sweep program. Your deposits at each program bank become eligible for FDIC insurance up to $250,000, inclusive of any other deposits you may already hold at the bank in the same ownership capacity. You can access the terms and conditions of the sweep program at <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"https://thread.bank/sweep-disclosure/\\">https://thread.bank/sweep-disclosure/</a> and a list of program banks at <a target=\\"_blank\\" href=\\"https://thread.bank/program-banks/\\">https://thread.bank/program-banks/</a>. Please contact <a href=\\"mailto:customerservice@thread.bank\\">customerservice@thread.bank</a> with questions on the sweep program. Certain conditions must be satisfied for pass-through deposit insurance coverage to apply. ","footer_logo":{"img_full":"https://res.cloudinary.com/de1ep59a0/images/v1733836881/main-logo-white/main-logo-white.svg?_i=AA","img_alt":"Agora"},"footer_logo_url":"agorareal.com","copyright_content":"<p>\xa9 2026 All rights reserved by Agora Real Estate Technologies US Inc.</p>\\n","footer_quick_links":[{"quick_link_like_custom_link":{"title":"Privacy Policy","url":"https://websiteapi.agorareal.com/privacy-policy/","target":""}},{"quick_link_like_custom_link":{"title":"Cookie Policy","url":"https://websiteapi.agorareal.com/cookie-policy/","target":""}},{"quick_link_like_custom_link":{"title":"Terms and Conditions","url":"https://websiteapi.agorareal.com/terms-conditions/","target":""}},{"quick_link_like_custom_link":{"title":"Payments Terms of Service","url":"https://agorareal.com/payments-terms-of-service/","target":""}},{"quick_link_like_custom_link":{"title":"Business Deposit Account Agreement","url":"https://disclosures.thread.bank/terms/agora/businessdepositaccountagreement.pdf","target":"_blank"}},{"quick_link_like_custom_link":{"title":"Electronic Disclosure & Consent","url":"https://websiteapi.agorareal.com/consent-electronic-disclosures/","target":""}},{"quick_link_like_custom_link":{"title":"DSAR form","url":"https://www.iubenda.com/dsar-form/en/68a359d9-70bb-48e4-afd3-1232dced4d66%20","target":"_blank"}}],"header_logo":{"img_full":"https://res.cloudinary.com/de1ep59a0/images/v1781005397/logo-primary-blue_25339ea6dc/logo-primary-blue_25339ea6dc.webp?_i=AA","img_alt":""},"light_header_logo":{"img_full":"https://res.cloudinary.com/de1ep59a0/images/v1781005397/logo-primary-blue_25339ea6dc/logo-primary-blue_25339ea6dc.webp?_i=AA","img_alt":""},"common_general_fields":{"toggle_light_header":true},"header_parent_menu":[{"parent_menu_custom":{"target":"","title":"Solution","url":"#"},"add_menu_items":"custom","menu_title":"about us","pagepost":{"ID":172,"post_author":"1","post_date":"2024-07-19 11:42:14","post_date_gmt":"2024-07-19 11:42:14","post_content":"","post_title":"About Agora: the best real estate investment experience","post_excerpt":"","post_status":"publi